# docs/RISK.md V267: the B1 sweep's He3_3000 row on QBBC AS IT SHIPS - nothing inactivated,
# ionElastic among the rest - through ref\b1ion\run.bat, which counts ionElastic. Its dose must be
# the sweep's QBBC column (V232: 600.455 nGy) to the digit: the instrument draws nothing.
/run/initialize
/control/verbose 0
/run/verbose 1

/gun/particle He3
/gun/energy 3000 MeV
/run/printProgress 10000
/run/beamOn 100000
